@ - Merman (if female, Mermaid)

Intrinsic water breathing.

Stats: HP:50 Str:18/** Dex:18 Con:12 Int:15 Wis:14 Cha:15

The usefulness of Mermans are that the player can polymorph
into one, and go into water i. e. swim in the moat without
fear of drowning.

The one disadvantage, you can't stay OUT of the water
for more than a few moves, you can't breath, you suffocate,
you die like any other fish.

Mermans and Mermaids are peaceful, they have a blessed
horn (useful if you kill one on the Castle level and you don't
have a musical instrument)

I guess you COULD have Merman Guards to swimaround in the moat
and wield blessed tridents.

HEY, THAT'S an idea for a neat nifty weapon!


The Blessed Rustproof +3 Trident of Poseidon

Slays all water dwelling creatures! Eels, electric eels, krakens,
Mermans, Mermaids ;)


